### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: source-derived-ergon-chefia-contract
### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase contract (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Reads the 360° item surface of RadarChefiaSubstituicao with titularNome, substitutoNome, substitutoPessoaId, and chefeEmExercicioNome (ERGadm00480).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@orgao = 2
@radarId = 30

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/radar-chefias-substituicoes/{{radarId}}/detail
Accept: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}
